# AI-Assisted Compiler Error Explanation & Auto-Fix Engine Using NLP

An intelligent diagnostic, automated code-repair, and developer tutoring platform (`INTELLIFIX`) that converts compiler diagnostics, syntax errors, and runtime tracebacks into plain-language explanations, validated hot-fixes, and security audits across Python, C++, and Java.

## Project Files

| File / Folder Name | Title | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `25CSB1A13_25CSB1A49 _CODES_COMPILER ERROR EXPLANATION USING NLP` | Complete Source Code & System Workspace | Core project workspace containing the Flask REST backend (`app.py`), tri-tier NLP explanation engine (`nlp_explainer.py`), 4 autonomous agents (`agent_orchestrator.py`), pre-execution security analyzer (`security_analyzer.py`), MITRE malware defense shield (`malware_detector.py`), multi-language compiler extractors (`error_extractor.py`, `java_extractor.py`), interactive web dashboards (`index.html`, `analytics.html`, `grader_studio.html`), and one-click launch script (`run_studio.bat`). |
| `screenshots` | Screenshots & Visual Proof | Complete collection of 16 high-resolution UI and execution screenshots, including the 5-Quadrant Web IDE, real-time AI error explanation and diff repair, pre-execution malware interception, Green IT carbon analytics dashboard, and the Agentic Auto-Grader & AI Tutor Studio. |
| `END_Project_Report.docx` | Comprehensive Final Project Report | In-depth final project thesis covering the abstract, problem formulation, NLP & compiler literature review, abstract syntax tree (AST) architecture, fine-tuning of the Flan-T5 transformer model, static CWE/OWASP security auditing, multi-agent evaluation pipelines, Green IT telemetry, empirical benchmark results, and future scope. |
| `TEST_CASES_README.txt` & `tc_01` – `tc_41` | Standardized Benchmark Test Suite | 57 enterprise-grade benchmark test files (1,000+ lines of code each) spanning common Python exceptions (syntax, indentation, name, type), 52+ CWE security exploits (SQLi, SSRF, XXE, ReDoS, deserialization), Java JVM runtime & compilation failures, C++ memory safety flaws, enterprise microservices, and active malware attack patterns (ransomware, worms, reverse shells). |
| `trained_model` | Fine-Tuned NLP Model Assets | Model directory containing the tokenizer configuration, vocabulary mappings (`spiece.model`), generation parameters, and architecture definitions for the locally fine-tuned Hugging Face `Flan-T5` error explanation and auto-fix model. |
| `Recording 2026-11-24 113828.mp4` | Final Project Video Demonstration | End-to-end screen recording showcasing the live system in action: multi-language error diagnosis, real-time AI hot-fix verification, pre-execution threat interception, continuous carbon emission tracking, dual-code plagiarism comparison, and 100-point rubric auto-grading. |
